    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράφραγμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>breastwork on the top of a wall</i> or <i>mound</i>,
			mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.115
			</span></i> ; of a ship, <i>bulwarks</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.25
			</span></i> ; <i>screen</i> or <i>curtain</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				514b
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ βουλευτηρίου π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				2.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. in
			sg., <i>barrior</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ ἐμπόδιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					400
				</span></i>
			.</div>
